# ⚡ Global EV Charging Infrastructure Analytics

## 📊 Power BI Interactive Dashboard

An interactive **Power BI dashboard** designed to analyze and visualize the global **Electric Vehicle (EV) charging infrastructure**.

This project provides insights into **charging stations, operators, station status, country-wise distribution, and infrastructure growth over time** using an interactive and user-friendly dashboard.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

The rapid growth of Electric Vehicles has increased the demand for reliable and accessible charging infrastructure.

This project analyzes EV charging station data to understand:

- 🌍 Country-wise distribution of charging stations
- 🏢 Major EV charging operators
- 🔌 Total charging connectors
- ✅ Operational station status
- 📈 Growth of charging infrastructure over time
- 🎛️ Interactive filtering and exploration

The dashboard transforms raw EV charging station data into meaningful and easy-to-understand business insights.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- 📌 Analyze the distribution of EV charging stations across countries
- 📌 Identify the top EV charging operators
- 📌 Analyze charging station operational status
- 📌 Track charging infrastructure growth over time
- 📌 Provide interactive filtering for better data exploration
- 📌 Build a clean and professional Power BI dashboard

---

## 📂 Dataset

The dataset contains information about EV charging stations.

### 📋 Key Columns

- 🆔 Station ID
- 📍 Station Title
- 🏠 Address
- 🏙️ Town
- 🗺️ State
- 📮 Postcode
- 🌍 Country
- 📌 Latitude
- 📌 Longitude
- 🏢 Operator
- ✅ Status
- 🔌 Number of Connectors
- ⚡ Connector Types
- 📅 Date Added

📊 **Records:** 10,000+ EV charging station records

📁 **Source:** Kaggle EV Charging Station Dataset

