---

## 📊 Dashboard Features

### 🔢 KPI Cards

The dashboard includes key performance indicators such as:

- 🔌 Total Charging Stations
- ⚡ Total Connectors
- 🌍 Total Countries
- ✅ Active / Operational Stations

---

### 📊 Top 10 Countries

A ranking visualization showing the countries with the highest number of EV charging stations.

**Used for:**
- Country comparison
- Infrastructure distribution
- Identifying leading EV markets

---

### 🏢 Top 10 Charging Operators

A comparison of the leading EV charging station operators.

**Used for:**
- Operator comparison
- Market presence analysis
- Identifying major infrastructure providers

---

### 🍩 Charging Station Status

A donut chart showing the distribution of charging stations based on their operational status.

**Used for:**
- Operational infrastructure analysis
- Active vs inactive station comparison

---

### 📈 Charging Station Growth

A line chart showing how EV charging stations have been added over time.

**Used for:**
- Growth analysis
- Infrastructure expansion trends
- Understanding development over time

---

## 🎛️ Interactive Filters

The dashboard includes interactive slicers:

- 🌍 Country
- ✅ Status
- 📅 Year

Users can select different values and dynamically explore the dashboard.

---

## 💡 Key Business Questions

This dashboard helps answer questions such as:

🔹 Which countries have the highest number of EV charging stations?

🔹 Which charging operators have the largest presence?

🔹 How many charging stations are currently operational?

🔹 How many charging connectors are available?

🔹 How has EV charging infrastructure grown over time?

🔹 How does the charging infrastructure change when filtering by country or year?

---

## 🧹 Data Preparation

The dataset was prepared using **Power Query**.

### Data Cleaning Steps

- Removed duplicate station records
- Checked and corrected data types
- Validated numerical fields
- Prepared date fields for trend analysis
- Standardized categorical fields
- Prepared data for Power BI visualization

---

## 🧮 DAX & Calculations

DAX measures were created to calculate important KPIs such as:

- Total Charging Stations
- Total Connectors
- Total Countries
- Active Stations
- Operator Counts
- Station Growth

These measures enable dynamic calculations when users interact with dashboard filters.

---

## 🎨 Dashboard Design

The dashboard was designed with a clean and simple layout:

```text
⚡ GLOBAL EV CHARGING INFRASTRUCTURE ANALYTICS

🎛️ Country | Status | Year

🔢 KPI CARDS
Stations | Connectors | Countries | Active Stations

📊 Top 10 Countries | 🏢 Top 10 Operators

🍩 Station Status | 📈 Station Growth
The design focuses on:

✨ Clean layout
🎯 Easy navigation
📊 Clear visual hierarchy
🎛️ Interactive filtering
💼 Business-oriented insights
